{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026qKGEwFZ7Kr1793284107.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美日宣布達成協議，將在日本聯合生產導彈。中方指美日安全合作，不應針對他國或損害他國利益。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人郭嘉昆指出︰「美日發展雙邊關係、開展安全合作，不應該破壞地區和平穩定，不應該針對他國或損害他國的利益。日本現政府執政以來，以應對威脅為名，不斷突破國際法、國內法規制，挑戰戰後國際秩序，威脅地區和平穩定，國際社會必須高度警惕、堅決遏制。」</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:53.196766+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T19:18:09.469553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:30.115075+00:00","content_hash":"582a2a7ee77252c673577bd47edf76af7266857178a684802bb850a34cf58972","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:53.196766+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}